    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Frequently asked questions about modular laboratory construction</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                What is a modular laboratory?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">A modular laboratory is a laboratory assembled from prefabricated building modules — as opposed to conventional solid construction. The modules are manufactured in the factory under controlled conditions and only connected on site. That saves time and cost and ensures consistently high <a href="/en/services/modular-construction" class="text-primary hover:underline">manufacturing quality</a>.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                How long does it take to build a lab container?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Depending on complexity, manufacture of a lab container takes a few weeks to months — considerably shorter than conventional new builds, which often take years. Standardised solutions such as the <a href="/en/lab-containers/labtogo" class="text-primary hover:underline">LABtoGO</a> can even be operational within a few days. More on the <a href="/en/magazine/lab-container-project-process" class="text-primary hover:underline">project process</a>.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Which laboratory types can be realised modularly?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Almost all laboratory types — from simple instrument laboratories via chemistry laboratories through to <a href="/en/magazine/bsl-2-bsl-3-container-lab" class="text-primary hover:underline">BSL-2 and BSL-3 containment laboratories</a> and <a href="/en/magazine/gmp-cleanroom-container-pharma-production" class="text-primary hover:underline">GMP cleanrooms</a>. The <a href="/en/services/equipment" class="text-primary hover:underline">laboratory equipment</a> is matched individually to the intended use.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Is a lab container as good as a conventional laboratory?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Modern lab containers meet exactly the same standards and safety requirements as conventional laboratories. Controlled <a href="/en/services/modular-construction" class="text-primary hover:underline">factory manufacture</a> even offers quality advantages over site manufacture. Lab containers can meet all common standards from S1 to S3.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                What does a modular container laboratory cost?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Costs depend on size, equipment and biosafety level. In principle, modular laboratories are often more economical than solid buildings thanks to efficient prefabrication and shorter construction time. You will find a detailed comparison in our guide <a href="/en/magazine/lab-containers-rent-or-buy" class="text-primary hover:underline">Rent vs buy a lab container</a>.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                What role does Smart Lab technology play in modular construction?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><a href="/en/services/smart-lab" class="text-primary hover:underline">Smart Lab integration</a> with IoT sensors, building management systems and remote maintenance is increasingly becoming the standard. In modular construction, networking can be implemented particularly efficiently, because all systems are already matched and tested in the factory.</div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
